  "description": "High-performance, radiant PDF generation and manipulation engine for .NET 8 and .NET 10. Generate invoices, dashboard reports, and documents from C#, Markdown, or HTML without headless browsers. Features stream manipulation, page slicing, PDF/A-1b/2b/3b archival, ZUGFeRD e-invoices, PKCS#12 digital signatures, AES-256 encryption, native charts, barcodes, QR codes, and AI/RAG metadata embedding.",
